{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish","id":1118567,"title":"Ideas for a Staff Fetish?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-20T08:19:52-07:00","id":1118567,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Ideas for a Staff Fetish?","content":"The CoG Ragabash who is a <a href=\"https://werewolf-blood-and-rage.obsidianportal.com/wikis/iskakku\" target=\"_blank\">iskakku</a> Martial Artist wants my Theurge to turn his staff into a Fetish.<br /> <br /> A bit of background on the Ragabash: He was born of Black Furies and adopted by the CoG. The Sept is water oriented, so he is the sailor of our pack. This character is more attuned to Black Unicorn than the usual peace loving CoG. The <a href=\"http://www.wood-database.com/bloodwood/\" target=\"_blank\">Brosimum rubescens</a> staff itself was carved by the Ragabash's father, so the staff is important to the character.<br /> <br /> We brain stormed for a bit and touched upon two ideas:<br /> <br /> 1. See if we can get a less powerful avatar of Black Unicorn to consent to be bound to the staff. Is this even a thing?<br /> <br /> 2. The Fetish could have some sort of fear effect on Banes. Not sure about the mechanics behind this idea.<br /> <br /> Anyone else got any ideas for a good staff Fetish? Yes, I realize I need to run all these by our ST, but I figured I'd troll for ideas here first.<br /> <br /> Any suggestions of Canon Staff Fetishes would be appreciated too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 07-20-2017, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T11:50:50-07:00","id":1118644,"title":"","content":"Power pole from dbz comes to mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T13:22:02-07:00","id":1118680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish#post1118567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. See if we can get a less powerful avatar of Black Unicorn to consent to be bound to the staff. Is this even a thing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Black Unicorn acts as a pack Totem, so each of his packs has a unique avatar of Black Unicorn spirit running around. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2. The Fetish could have some sort of fear effect on Banes. Not sure about the mechanics behind this idea. </div> </div> </div>Mechanics would probably depend a bit on how you want this to manifest. Do you want to do a Gandalf &quot;You Shall Not Pass&quot; move that causes Banes to flee for a short period of time? Do you want an aura of menace that weaker banes will avoid, but stronger ones can power through? Do you want the power to cower a bane at a time with fear so it is powerless? There's a lot of options with fear effects.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Anyone else got any ideas for a good staff Fetish? </div> </div> </div>Well, if you want to keep up with the Black Unicorn theme, I think there's a lot of options in something a bit boring, but practical, defense boosting options. The ability to defend others would be particularly useful since the game doesn't really give a good default for that. There's a Mage Wonder from Forged by Dragon's Fire that gives the staff wielder extra actions that can only be spent on defensive options, and can be used to block fire arms attacks. Being able to do that for other people would make defending the innocent in combat a lot easier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T14:39:49-07:00","id":1118704,"title":"","content":"I've made staff fetishes that act as gnosis batteries that also function to ward off/weaken banes in my games. There is also the battle mandala gift that drains essence. Could be a neat feature to add to a staff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T14:44:10-07:00","id":1118707,"title":"","content":"If you want a story flavored idea have a rattle that mimicks the sound of water on the staff that when activated makes your opponent have the sudden sensation of drowning or being crushed under a massive body of water. It could sap their actions, give them penalties to their rolls, or just straight up do some damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T15:57:15-07:00","id":1118736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1118644#post1118644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Power pole from dbz comes to mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would probably have the same type of spirit as the Kitsune's As-You-Will Sleeves empowering it, since it was the origin of the concept that said fetish was based on (Hammer &amp; Klaive).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T23:27:34-07:00","id":1118849,"title":"","content":"I think it would be much harder to convince a jaggling avatar to be bound into a fetish instead of a gaffling. Gafflings aren't supposed to be really sentient while jagglings are. I think any jaggling would be extremely reluctant to become a fetish. Is there any reason why you can't find a gaffling of the Black Unicorn?<br /> <br /> If you are looking for mechanical fear effects, there are various Gifts you could use as a baseline. Staredown, Howls in the Night, True Fear, Howl of the Banshee, Visage of Fenris, or Paralyzing Stare could work as a guide depending on what exactly what you want to model. You might also want to look at the Spirit Whistle fetish which makes spirits run away in fear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T02:55:52-07:00","id":1119441,"title":"","content":"Have you considered an effect like the Harmony Flute? It's not fear-inducing, but it seems like something a Child of Gaia and an iskakku martial artist might like to use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T19:38:57-07:00","id":1120189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lunar Falcon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1118704#post1118704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've made staff fetishes that act as gnosis batteries that also function to ward off/weaken banes in my games. There is also the battle mandala gift that drains essence. Could be a neat feature to add to a staff.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is cool. I'll have to run this by the ST. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1118849#post1118849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it would be much harder to convince a jaggling avatar to be bound into a fetish instead of a gaffling. Gafflings aren't supposed to be really sentient while jagglings are. I think any jaggling would be extremely reluctant to become a fetish. Is there any reason why you can't find a gaffling of the Black Unicorn?<br /> <br /> If you are looking for mechanical fear effects, there are various Gifts you could use as a baseline. Staredown, Howls in the Night, True Fear, Howl of the Banshee, Visage of Fenris, or Paralyzing Stare could work as a guide depending on what exactly what you want to model. You might also want to look at the Spirit Whistle fetish which makes spirits run away in fear.</div> </div> </div> </div>We could find a Gaffling of Black Unicorn. The level of the spirit doesn't matter as long as it is Black Unicorn. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T21:11:30-07:00","id":1125083,"title":"","content":"So what came of this decision? I'm curious if you got it done or are still working on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T22:48:03-07:00","id":1125109,"title":"","content":"Well, depending on who you ask. some might say &quot;Feet&quot; and other might say &quot;Heavy Bondage&quot;<br /> OHH! Item based! oh ok, sorry...hurmm<br /> <br /> my nuwisha used to carry a walking stick that allowed him to manipulate wind (cutting wind or small tornados, mainly to create dust based distractions or to use it to fall slower from a great high...or to do distance lethal damage)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T13:23:06-07:00","id":1126015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1125109#post1125109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, depending on who you ask. some might say &quot;Feet&quot; and other might say &quot;Heavy Bondage&quot;<br /> OHH! Item based! oh ok, sorry...hurmm</div> </div> </div> </div>Nobody wants to hear about your ball-and-chain's steel-toed army boots. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1125109#post1125109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">my nuwisha used to carry a walking stick that allowed him to manipulate wind (cutting wind or small tornados, mainly to create dust based distractions or to use it to fall slower from a great high...or to do distance lethal damage)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, I like this idea. I suppose you'd want an air spirit, or at least some kind of chaotic wyld spirit, for this effect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T13:42:56-07:00","id":1126025,"title":"","content":"Yeah the monkey king staff is a classic power...<br /> <br /> But how about a river spirit bound to the staff so you can make the ground slippy based on your gnosis roll and tapping the floor, so either increases the people effected or area of phantom slick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T00:09:07-07:00","id":1127952,"title":"","content":"The other cool effect would be something like an effect of spider...Hear me Out... I Might Be High.<br /> <br /> What about a cane that you can stick in any surface and be pulled or moved by it, as if was your own personal elevator?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T00:43:39-07:00","id":1128357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1118567-ideas-for-a-staff-fetish?p=1127952#post1127952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The other cool effect would be something like an effect of spider...Hear me Out... I Might Be High.<br /> <br /> What about a cane that you can stick in any surface and be pulled or moved by it, as if was your own personal elevator?</div> </div> </div> </div>Inventive, I like it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T11:31:12-07:00","id":1130368,"title":"","content":"The game is currently between Storytellers right now, so nothing came of the staff unfortunately. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}